          "code": "IDENTIFYUSERINTENT",
          "id": "1763815769837",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1763815769842_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an expert in converting a user question to a structured query output. \nThe accuracy of your output is important and will be used to query objects from a suggestion system.\n\nYou are an intent extraction assistant.  \nGiven a user input message, perform the following tasks based on the definitions provided:\n\n**Intent Types:**  \n- PERSON_ACTIVITY: To get more specific details of any person.\n- REPORT_ACTIVITY: To get details about executing the reports.\n- POLICY_ACTIVITY: To get details from policy documents.\n\n**Intent Categories:**  \n- For PERSON_ACTIVITY: DF_ANA (Analytics), DF_EVT (Events), DF_BAN (Banners), PER (Personal/Contact info), CMP (Compensation), TAL (Talent/performance), ABS (Absences)\n- For REPORT_ACTIVITY: REP (Report)\n- For POLICY_ACTIVITY: POL (Policy)\n\n**Intent Level:**\n- DIRECTS\n\nProvide your answer as a JSON object using the structure below and include ALL detected intents.\n\nExample:\n```json\n{\n  \"userIntent\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"PERSON_ACTIVITY\",\n      \"categories\": [\"DF_ANA\", \"DF_EVT\", \"DF_BAN\", \"EMP\",\"PER\"],\n      \"level\": \"DIRECTS\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"REPORT_ACTIVITY\",\n      \"categories\": [\"REP\"],\n      \"level\": \"DIRECTS\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n**Current User Message:** \nUser Prompt : `{{$context.$variables.userPrompt}}`\n\n**Required Output:** A json object with structure {userIntent: array}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"userIntent\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"string\"\n      ],\n      \"level\": \"string\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
